    "blurb": "Retrieves active Camunda process tasks",
    "overview": "A smart Camunda connector that securely retrieves and monitors active human tasks from process instances using Operate, Tasklist, and Keycloak, enabling seamless automation and real-time process visibility.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Intelligent task retrieval and process monitoring",
    "splashDescription": "The Task Information connector automates the retrieval and monitoring of active tasks in Camunda process instances. It interacts directly with the Camunda Operate and Tasklist APIs, securely authenticated through Keycloak, to identify and return the metadata of the available human task based on the current process state. By continuously checking task readiness and navigating sub-process chains when necessary, the connector eliminates the need for manual queries or complex API integrations. It provides a unified, real-time view of process execution, allowing external systems and automation processes to act based on accurate and up-to-date process information. This connector is particularly useful for process orchestration, process monitoring, and automated decision-making scenarios, where knowing the metadata of a user task is essential.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/632752/overview/img13218377085578344508.png?0d0f037446925e98e005a13b5516ead9",
